bf.avif?t=1773851779\" width=1170 height=597 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card holds a powerful, unique ability. Find, collect, buy, upgrade, or destroy them - only the right deck leads to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/6ca83137e5c6a066ab6f5a1a16d7bd6f.poster.avif?t=1773851779\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/6ca83137e5c6a066ab6f5a1a16d7bd6f.webm?t=1773851779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/6ca83137e5c6a066ab6f5a1a16d7bd6f.mp4?t=1773851779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only if you find two matching cards can\u00a0you unleash their abilities in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/3c2d30147ae606ada2a1560c6af1a270.avif?t=1773851779\" width=1170 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful special abilities - cards that don't need to be revealed but are available to you once per level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal yourself, attack, or temporarily reveal all game cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They come in many forms and can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rare relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/2cb0a23882524d5f3ebf086798905d78.avif?t=1773851779\" width=1170 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find rare relics that provide you with permanent passive effects to support you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected places, encounters, secrets, and surprises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/62a6219d35993de15ea6c685953b1b2b.poster.avif?t=1773851779\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/62a6219d35993de15ea6c685953b1b2b.webm?t=1773851779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/extras/62a6219d35993de15ea6c685953b1b2b.mp4?t=1773851779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disscover mysterious places, unlock enigmatic chests, or play strange games that could give you everything - or cost you everything.</p>","developers":["aim up games - Peter Thom\u00e4"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930140/e28584066aae5bb41aa70de6bc53664fa7e7bdd5/header.jpg?t=1773851779","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930140/1597298458/dcce5aa676f122d498b1e2381fd9b8ec070a85e8/1773850480/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773851777","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930140/1597298458/dcce5aa676f122d498b1e2381fd9b8ec070a85e8/1773850480/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773851777","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930140/1597298458/dcce5aa676f122d498b1e2381fd9b8ec070a85e8/1773850480/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773851777","id":257181473,"name":